{"id":"799dbc6630c443a3","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-gl-finite-decision.md","title":"有界有限模型检查判定GL定理性","display":"thm-gl-finite-decision — 有界有限模型检查判定GL定理性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-gl-finite-decision","aliases":["72-thm-gl-finite-decision"],"display":"thm-gl-finite-decision — 有界有限模型检查判定GL定理性","depends_on":["[[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]","[[72-df-modal-substitution]]","[[72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §2 finite adequate model construction, print478–480/PDF490–492; explicit local bounded checker","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local finite enumeration argument reviewed; inherits finite-completeness proof restrictions","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","revision_2026_10_22":"保留有限完备性上游的来源证明限制"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-gl-finite-decision"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-gl-finite-decision</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-finite-decision — 有界有限模型检查判定GL定理性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d40b90e274cadbda\" href=\"?note=d40b90e274cadbda\" title=\"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness\">72-thm-gl-finite-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"50496a022b75cf4f\" href=\"?note=50496a022b75cf4f\" title=\"72-df-modal-substitution\">72-df-modal-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d995f8111ca2cd42\" href=\"?note=d995f8111ca2cd42\" title=\"72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics\">72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §2 finite adequate model construction, print478–480/PDF490–492; explicit local bounded checker"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local finite enumeration argument reviewed; inherits finite-completeness proof restrictions"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"保留有限完备性上游的来源证明限制"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_A\">\\(\\Phi_A\\)</span> 与有限反模型界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{|\\Phi_A|}\">\\(2^{|\\Phi_A|}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d40b90e274cadbda\" href=\"?note=d40b90e274cadbda\" title=\"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness\">72-thm-gl-finite-completeness</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pv}_m\">\\(\\operatorname{pv}_m\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"50496a022b75cf4f\" href=\"?note=50496a022b75cf4f\" title=\"72-df-modal-substitution\">72-df-modal-substitution</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 为正自然数，同时作为标准有限世界集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(x,y)\">\\(R(x,y)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\\to\\mathcal P(n)\">\\(v:\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\\to\\mathcal P(n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{n,A}(v)\">\\(e_{n,A}(v)\\)</span> 在下式延成全赋值。满足集合使用原Kripke语义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_A,\\mathcal Q_A,d_m(A)\">\\(b_A,\\mathcal Q_A,d_m(A)\\)</span> 在下式以有限集合、函数和分支构造；空的全称条件取真。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nb_A&amp;:=2^{|\\Phi_A|},\\\\\n\\mathcal Q_A&amp;:=\\{\\langle n,R,v\\rangle:1\\le n\\le b_A,\\ R\\subseteq n^2,\\\n\\forall x\\in n\\ \\neg R(x,x),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\forall x,y,z\\in n\\ ((R(x,y)\\land R(y,z))\\Rightarrow R(x,z)),\\\nv\\in\\mathcal P(n)^{\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)}\\},\\\\\ne_{n,A}(v)(i)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}v(i),&amp;i\\in\\operatorname{pv}_m(A),\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;i\\notin\\operatorname{pv}_m(A),\\end{cases}\\\\\nd_m(A)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\forall\\langle n,R,v\\rangle\\in\\mathcal Q_A\\\n(⟦ A⟧_{\\langle n,R,e_{n,A}(v)\\rangle}=n),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\exists\\langle n,R,v\\rangle\\in\\mathcal Q_A\\\n(⟦ A⟧_{\\langle n,R,e_{n,A}(v)\\rangle}\\ne n),\\end{cases}\\\\\nd_m&amp;:\\mathcal F_m\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad d_m(A)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nb_A&amp;:=2^{|\\Phi_A|},\\\\\n\\mathcal Q_A&amp;:=\\{\\langle n,R,v\\rangle:1\\le n\\le b_A,\\ R\\subseteq n^2,\\\n\\forall x\\in n\\ \\neg R(x,x),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\forall x,y,z\\in n\\ ((R(x,y)\\land R(y,z))\\Rightarrow R(x,z)),\\\nv\\in\\mathcal P(n)^{\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)}\\},\\\\\ne_{n,A}(v)(i)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}v(i),&amp;i\\in\\operatorname{pv}_m(A),\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;i\\notin\\operatorname{pv}_m(A),\\end{cases}\\\\\nd_m(A)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\forall\\langle n,R,v\\rangle\\in\\mathcal Q_A\\\n(⟦ A⟧_{\\langle n,R,e_{n,A}(v)\\rangle}=n),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\exists\\langle n,R,v\\rangle\\in\\mathcal Q_A\\\n(⟦ A⟧_{\\langle n,R,e_{n,A}(v)\\rangle}\\ne n),\\end{cases}\\\\\nd_m&amp;:\\mathcal F_m\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad d_m(A)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有枚举均有限：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 有上界，关系有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{n^2}\">\\(2^{n^2}\\)</span> 种，相关变量赋值有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{n|\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)|}\">\\(2^{n|\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)|}\\)</span> 种；公式求值由有限树递归及有限后继枚举完成，所以显示构造给出停机的有限判定程序。有限传递非自反框架都是GL框架，可靠性使所有定理通过。若不是定理，有限典范模型给大小不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_A\">\\(b_A\\)</span> 的反模型；将其世界用某个n重命名，局部性允许将未出现的变量置空，于是它出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q_A\">\\(\\mathcal Q_A\\)</span> 中并使程序返回0。这里没有声称多项式复杂度，也没有对无限假设集给紧致性或判定性结论。</p>\n<p>新增部分是有限枚举构造及其与既有反模型界的连接；有限典范模型及完备性本身沿用上游的来源与证明状态，未由本算法重新核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"50496a022b75cf4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"d995f8111ca2cd42","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$\\Phi_A$ 与有限反模型界 $2^{|\\Phi_A|}$ 取 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]；$\\operatorname{pv}_m$ 取 [[72-df-modal-substitution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"50496a022b75cf4f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$\\Phi_A$ 与有限反模型界 $2^{|\\Phi_A|}$ 取 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]；$\\operatorname{pv}_m$ 取 [[72-df-modal-substitution]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_A","display":false},{"tex":"2^{|\\Phi_A|}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pv}_m","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"R(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\\to\\mathcal P(n)","display":false},{"tex":"e_{n,A}(v)","display":false},{"tex":"b_A,\\mathcal Q_A,d_m(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nb_A&:=2^{|\\Phi_A|},\\\\\n\\mathcal Q_A&:=\\{\\langle n,R,v\\rangle:1\\le n\\le b_A,\\ R\\subseteq n^2,\\\n\\forall x\\in n\\ \\neg R(x,x),\\\\\n&\\hspace{17mm}\\forall x,y,z\\in n\\ ((R(x,y)\\land R(y,z))\\Rightarrow R(x,z)),\\\nv\\in\\mathcal P(n)^{\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)}\\},\\\\\ne_{n,A}(v)(i)&:=\\begin{cases}v(i),&i\\in\\operatorname{pv}_m(A),\\\\\\varnothing,&i\\notin\\operatorname{pv}_m(A),\\end{cases}\\\\\nd_m(A)&:=\\begin{cases}1,&\\forall\\langle n,R,v\\rangle\\in\\mathcal Q_A\\\n(⟦ A⟧_{\\langle n,R,e_{n,A}(v)\\rangle}=n),\\\\\n0,&\\exists\\langle n,R,v\\rangle\\in\\mathcal Q_A\\\n(⟦ A⟧_{\\langle n,R,e_{n,A}(v)\\rangle}\\ne n),\\end{cases}\\\\\nd_m&:\\mathcal F_m\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad d_m(A)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"2^{n^2}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{n|\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)|}","display":false},{"tex":"b_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal Q_A","display":false}],"bytes":3075,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-445","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-finite-decision|thm-gl-finite-decision — 有界有限模型检查判定GL定理性]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-454","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-finite-decision]]"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"GL有限判定：[[72-thm-gl-finite-decision]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-356","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-finite-decision|thm-gl-finite-decision — 有界有限模型检查判定GL定理性]]"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-gl-finite-decision]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-468","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-gl-finite-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["d40b90e274cadbda","50496a022b75cf4f","d995f8111ca2cd42"]}